{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.16] Got to breathe\n[00:02.16] You can't take that from me\n[00:03.82] 'Cause that's all that you left at my—\n[00:06.52] Hey (It's gon' be a hit, bro)\n[00:13.56] You're like a breath of— (Oh)\n[00:16.46] You're like a breath of fresh air (Oh)\n[00:22.16] You're like a breath of— (Ayy)\n[Chorus]\n[00:23.70] You're like a breath of fresh air, I can breathe\n[00:25.46] But baby, when you're not here, vacancy\n[00:27.70] You're like a breath of fresh air, fresh air\n[00:30.98] I need you to myself, yeah, I won't share\n[00:33.58] When I hold your hand, it feels like I'm in Bel-Air\n[00:36.48] Doesn't hurt to say I actually live in Bel-Air\n[00:39.54] But it don't feel like Bel-Air when you're not there\n[00:42.26] Feels like I'm back in the slums, gunshots in the air (Grrah, grrah, grrah)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:46.86] PTSD, yeah, I have it, I'm not afraid to admit that\n[00:51.62] But you fill the void, yeah, you give me a piece of myself I thought I would never get back\n[00:57.68] I hope you see that, my forever girl, you have no choice but to be that\n[01:03.58] You're my addiction and my relapse\n[01:06.48] Been through my addictions and relapses, you heard what I said\n[01:11.44] I know the truth bleeds, not as much as I bled (I bled)\n[01:14.34] I make the truth cry, yeah, thousands of tears\n[01:16.84] Truthfully, I just smile when you’re right here (Yeah, oh, yeah)\n[Chorus]\n[01:20.30] You're like a breath of fresh air, I can breathe\n[01:23.10] But baby, when you're not here, vacancy\n[01:25.54] You're like a breath of fresh-air, fresh-air\n[01:28.74] I need you to myself, yeah, I won't share\n[01:31.44] When I hold your hand, it feels like I'm in Bel-Air\n[01:34.30] Doesn't hurt to say I actually live in Bel-Air\n[01:37.20] But it don't feel like Bel-Air when you're not there\n[01:40.12] Feels like I'm back in the slums, gunshots in the air (Grrah, grrah, grrah)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:44.36] This year, this year\n[01:45.40] Who would've thought